startDestination: A global variable determining the initial navigation route ("home" or "onboarding").

workout: A global variable used to pass the selected workout name to WorkoutActivity.

CurrentReps, CurrentSets: Global variables that appear to hold temporary values for the last workout's sets and reps, displayed on the DetailedWorkoutScreen. Their lifecycle and update mechanism are not fully defined in the provided code snippet but are essential for their display.

